      "instance_name": "pedestrian_safety_warning",
      "label": "Pedestrian Safety Warning",
      "description": "The phrase 'be careful with pedestrians' is a common road safety warning, typically used by drivers to alert them to the presence of people walking near or on roads. In this context, it is juxtaposed with a graphic image of a fatal accident, creating irony or dark humor. Understanding this phrase as a standard safety message is necessary to interpret the meme's setup.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
