      "@type": "BackgroundKnowledge",
      "instance_name": "road_accident_context",
      "label": "Road Accident Context",
      "description": "The image of a person lying dead on the road with blood and another person in a car implies a traffic accident. This requires background knowledge of how road accidents occur, the consequences of such incidents, and the typical response (e.g., emergency services, legal implications). The meme uses this context to create a shocking contrast with the top image.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
