      "instance_name": "dark_humor_meme_tropes",
      "label": "Dark Humor Meme Tropes",
      "description": "The meme relies on the trope of juxtaposing a mundane or seemingly harmless situation (men walking) with a violent or tragic one (fatal accident) to create dark humor or irony. This trope is common in internet memes and requires understanding of meme culture and comedic conventions involving shock value.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
        "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#analysis_0e24a4e0"
