      "label": "Misogyny in Meme Context",
      "description": "The image of a dead woman on the road, contrasted with the men walking, may implicitly reference misogynistic stereotypes that portray women as vulnerable or as a threat to men's safety. This requires background knowledge of gender-based stereotypes and how they are sometimes used in humor or satire, even if unintentionally.",
